cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "DLPMI: Differentiable Lumped-Parameter Model Inversion for Environmental Tracer Data"
abstract: >-
  Lumped-parameter model inversion for environmental tracer data using
  automatic differentiation rather than finite-difference Jacobians, with
  identifiability, tracer information-content, model-structure and Bayesian
  diagnostics.
authors:
